{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi5DJLbWm9AibLRAts5y","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QvtdT1kTMtZ6SxTiRdwDpn","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"mkdir -p docs && cat > engine/PATCHES.md <<'EOF'\n# Engine patches (my-3D2dge v0.85.2, engine/my-3d2dge.js)\n\n1. **PlayStation face-button glyphs in the 5x7 font** (`G57`: `✕ ○ □ △`). `input.label('x')` returns `✕` on a\n   PlayStation pad and the font drew it as `?`.\n2. **`Input.halfKeys(preset, side)` honours `preset.halves[side]`** (a non-enumerable per-action code list), so two\n   players on one keyboard get rugby layouts (WASD + Space/F/C/R/Q/E/Shift; arrows + . / ; ' K L ,) instead of the\n   engine's fixed button order.\n3. **`E.Dialog` per-letter hook** (`dialog.onLetter(ch, index, text)`), so each speaker gets an Animalese-style\n   babble voice (one syllable per letter) instead of the single shared blip.\n\nPlanned patch 3 (an `E.Menu` font scale) was not needed: the game draws its own 10-foot `BigMenu`.\nEOF\ncat > docs/DATA.md <<'EOF'\n# Thugby Turbo data formats (for designers)\n\nAll content lives in `src/01-data.js`; balance numbers in `src/00-core.js` (`TUNE_DEFS`).\n\n- **Teams** `TT.TEAMS[]`: `{ id, name, short, home/away kits { cloth, trim, pants, boot }, crest [kind, c1, c2],\n  style { aggression, pass, kick, cheap, supers }, diff (-1..1 shift of the CPU difficulty), players[7] }`.\n  Player: `P_(name, nickname, build, size, hair, hairColor, skin, hat, [SPD, POW, HND, KCK, TKL], extra)`; roster\n  order is PROP, HOOKER, PROP, SCRUM-HALF, FLY-HALF, CENTRE, WING. `extra.boss` makes a player need a gang tackle.\n- **Venues** `TT.VENUES[]`: `{ id, name, time day|dusk|night, weather rain|wind|clear|storm, hazard mud|chicken|flames|lightning, music (a TT.SONGS id), grass [r,g,b], stand face, standSide, standTop, sky, skyline hills|docks|chimneys|city, boards[] }`.\n- **Power-ups** `TT.POWERUPS`: `{ name, time (s), line (commentary) }`; effects in `src/13-arcade.js`.\n- **Commentary** `TT.LINES[category] = [['b' | 'r', text]]` (Barry / Ros); `{$player} {$team} {$score} {$venue}`.\n- **Story** `TT.STORY[id] = { set pub|pitch|tunnel|podium, title, lines [[speaker, text]], choices, half, won }`;\n  speakers are cast ids (`TT.CAST`) or `team:index`. Dialog markup: `{shake}`, `{wave}`, `{w=.4}`.\n- **Cup** `TT.CUP[] = { id, name, opp, venue }`.\n- **Drills** `TT.DRILLS[] = { id, name, teach, prompt }`; setups, goals and SHOW ME scripts in `TT.drills` (`src/43-scene-match.js`).\n- **Difficulty** `TT.DIFF.Rookie|Pro|Legend` (CPU numbers only).\n- **TUNE** `[key, label, group, default, min, max, step]`: every one shows as a live slider in the dev panel.\nEOF\ndate '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S'","description":"Write patch notes, data docs, get time"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":457,"cache_read_input_tokens":530289,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":457},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0b392508-0a9c-4851-a1e8-b9fce2e4b886","uuid":"a3071094-2424-4032-a117-b0f5a5a070b1","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:49:42.740Z","request_id":"req_011Cgi5DHyGZyDPC1HVDHtsn","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01QvtdT1kTMtZ6SxTiRdwDpn":{"command":"mkdir -p docs && cat > engine/PATCHES.md <<'EOF'\n# Engine patches (my-3D2dge v0.85.2, engine/my-3d2dge.js)\n\n1. **PlayStation face-button glyphs in the 5x7 font** (`G57`: `✕ ○ □ △`). `input.label('x')` returns `✕` on a\n   PlayStation pad and the font drew it as `?`.\n2. **`Input.halfKeys(preset, side)` honours `preset.halves[side]`** (a non-enumerable per-action code list), so two\n   players on one keyboard get rugby layouts (WASD + Space/F/C/R/Q/E/Shift; arrows + . / ; ' K L ,) instead of the\n   engine's fixed button order.\n3. **`E.Dialog` per-letter hook** (`dialog.onLetter(ch, index, text)`), so each speaker gets an Animalese-style\n   babble voice (one syllable per letter) instead of the single shared blip.\n\nPlanned patch 3 (an `E.Menu` font scale) was not needed: the game draws its own 10-foot `BigMenu`.\nEOF\ncat > docs/DATA.md <<'EOF'\n# Thugby Turbo data formats (for designers)\n\nAll content lives in `src/01-data.js`; balance numbers in `src/00-core.js` (`TUNE_DEFS`).\n\n- **Teams** `TT.TEAMS[]`: `{ id, name, short, home/away kits { cloth, trim, pants, boot }, crest [kind, c1, c2],\n  style { aggression, pass, kick, cheap, supers }, diff (-1..1 shift of the CPU difficulty), players[7] }`.\n  Player: `P_(name, nickname, build, size, hair, hairColor, skin, hat, [SPD, POW, HND, KCK, TKL], extra)`; roster\n  order is PROP, HOOKER, PROP, SCRUM-HALF, FLY-HALF, CENTRE, WING. `extra.boss` makes a player need a gang tackle.\n- **Venues** `TT.VENUES[]`: `{ id, name, time day|dusk|night, weather rain|wind|clear|storm, hazard mud|chicken|flames|lightning, music (a TT.SONGS id), grass [r,g,b], stand face, standSide, standTop, sky, skyline hills|docks|chimneys|city, boards[] }`.\n- **Power-ups** `TT.POWERUPS`: `{ name, time (s), line (commentary) }`; effects in `src/13-arcade.js`.\n- **Commentary** `TT.LINES[category] = [['b' | 'r', text]]` (Barry / Ros); `{$player} {$team} {$score} {$venue}`.\n- **Story** `TT.STORY[id] = { set pub|pitch|tunnel|podium, title, lines [[speaker, text]], choices, half, won }`;\n  speakers are cast ids (`TT.CAST`) or `team:index`. Dialog markup: `{shake}`, `{wave}`, `{w=.4}`.\n- **Cup** `TT.CUP[] = { id, name, opp, venue }`.\n- **Drills** `TT.DRILLS[] = { id, name, teach, prompt }`; setups, goals and SHOW ME scripts in `TT.drills` (`src/43-scene-match.js`).\n- **Difficulty** `TT.DIFF.Rookie|Pro|Legend` (CPU numbers only).\n- **TUNE** `[key, label, group, default, min, max, step]`: every one shows as a live slider in the dev panel.\nEOF\ndate '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S'","description":"Write patch notes, data docs, get time"}}}
