{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says (TASK.md describes the game). Done when: the bundled single .html file exists in this folder's root, every feature in TASK.md is implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, exit-interview.json in this folder's root parses as JSON and answers every field, and your final reply contains the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections.]: The HTML exists in the folder root and exit-interview.json parses with every field filled, and the final reply contains all four sections. But the transcript does not show every TASK.md feature verified: the final reply concedes the aim gauge is only a small overlay in the corner, and the reply's own feature table maps items to test names rather than showing each TASK.md feature passing. The checker (test/taskcheck.mjs) covers 18 requirements in one line each, and the 'Audio' check was initially a false match. The Testing Feedback and Source Information sections were written in the transcript before the final build, so they are not confirmed to match the shipped build's own answers. The completion condition's wording that every TASK.md feature is implemented and verified is not clearly demonstrated in the transcript."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0b392508-0a9c-4851-a1e8-b9fce2e4b886","uuid":"852da7a9-db2c-4922-8973-2039cd2b5edd","timestamp":"2026-11-04T15:07:33.868Z","isSynthetic":true}
